  "body": "Hi all.\r\nI've seen a similar thread in these boards relating to issues with setting url_preview_enabled: True causing my Matrix homeserver to lose connectivity.  Unfortunately those threads offered no resolution, so I am guessing that the posters had their issues resolved.\r\nDoes anyone know what I am doing wrong to cause the server to effectively die by turning this option on? I'd really like to have URL previews working.\r\nAny help greatly appreciated.\r\nDave",
